<title>NEW ZEALAND: LWR sees higher profit in 1997 year.</title>
<headline>LWR sees higher profit in 1997 year.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>LWR Industries said on Thursday it was confident of exceeding last year's pre-tax profit of NZ$13.2 million in the year to June 30, 1997.</p>
</text>
